# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Dávid Péter Kovács et al. (2021). Linear Atomic Cluster Expansion Force Fields for Organic Molecules: Beyond RMSE.
#   Journal of Chemical Theory and Computation. doi:10.1021/acs.jctc.1c00647
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 e200a91a0885c4fc...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 35 (Method/model). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the models the authors trained themselves and compare:
# linear ACE, sGDML, GAP and ANI (the last initialised from ANI-2x) on the
# ten rMD17 molecules with 1000 training configurations (Table 2) and on
# the 3BPA data set introduced here, fitted at 300 K and at mixed
# temperatures and tested at 300, 600 and 1200 K (Table 6), plus the
# pretrained ANI-2x on the 3BPA test sets. Literature columns and the
# classical force field are not encoded.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-kovacs2021 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Kovacs et al. (2021): linear atomic cluster expansion force fields for organic molecules, beyond RMSE" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-kovacs2021 .

entity:article-kovacs2021 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.1c00647> ;
    schema:datePublished "2021"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Linear Atomic Cluster Expansion Force Fields for Organic Molecules: Beyond RMSE" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0854-2635> ,
        entity:person-Oord-kovacs2021 ,
        entity:person-Kucera-kovacs2021 ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8727-8333> ,
        entity:person-Cole-kovacs2021 ,
        entity:person-Ortner-kovacs2021 ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8180-2034> .

